# 💼 DEVJOBS

### Job Management Platform

> Full-stack job management platform built with Python and Django, featuring authentication, authorization, complete CRUD operations and PostgreSQL-ready deployment.

---

## 🚀 Overview

**DEVJOBS** is a web application for managing job listings.

The platform allows users to create an account, authenticate, publish job opportunities and manage their own listings through a permission-based CRUD system.

The project was built with a focus on **backend development using Django**, authentication, authorization, database management and clean application structure.

---

## ✨ Features

- [x] User registration
- [x] User authentication
- [x] Login and logout
- [x] Create job listings
- [x] List available jobs
- [x] View job details
- [x] Edit job listings
- [x] Delete job listings
- [x] "My Jobs" dashboard
- [x] Ownership-based permissions
- [x] Success and error messages
- [x] Responsive navigation
- [x] Bootstrap UI
- [x] Production deployment configuration

---

## 🔐 Authorization

Users can manage only the jobs they own.

```text
Authenticated User
       │
       ▼
    Job Request
       │
       ▼
   Ownership Check
       │
   ┌───┴────┐
   │        │
   ▼        ▼
 Owner    Not Owner
   │        │
   ▼        ▼
Allowed   Denied
```

This prevents users from editing or deleting job listings belonging to other accounts.

